{
  "name": "AI Video - Form, Script Edit, 2D Images, Gemini Voice, Canva",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## AI Video \u2192 Canva\n**Form \u2192 Gemini script \u2192 YOU EDIT \u2192 2D images + Gemini voice per scene \u2192 upload to Canva**\n\n1. Fill keys in **Config** (Gemini key, Canva access token)\n2. Click **Execute workflow** / open the Form Trigger test URL\n3. Review the script on the edit page, change it or leave blank to approve\n4. Final page gives you the Canva design link\n\nCanva tokens from the Connect API expire (~4h). Later switch to an OAuth2 credential.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 520
      },
      "name": "Setup Notes",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -60,
        -260
      ],
      "id": "setup-notes"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Canva limits\nThe Canva Connect API can upload images/audio and create a design, but it cannot build a multi-page video timeline.\n\nThis workflow uploads every scene image + voice to Canva Uploads and creates a 1080x1920 design starting with scene 1.\n\nIf you have **Canva Enterprise** + a Brand Template, enable the two disabled Autofill nodes to fill all pages with images + captions. Voice files are then dragged onto pages in Canva.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 520
      },
      "name": "Canva Notes",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        2740,
        -260
      ],
      "id": "canva-notes"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "formTitle": "AI Video Generator",
        "formDescription": "Enter a topic. I will write the script, you can edit it, then I build the scenes.",
        "formFields": {
          "values": [
            {
              "fieldLabel": "Topic",
              "fieldType": "text",
              "placeholder": "e.g. 5 facts about the pyramids",
              "requiredField": true
            },
            {
              "fieldLabel": "Number of scenes",
              "fieldType": "number",
              "placeholder": "5"
            },
            {
              "fieldLabel": "Voice",
              "fieldType": "dropdown",
              "fieldOptions": {
                "values": [
                  {
                    "option": "Kore"
                  },
                  {
                    "option": "Puck"
                  },
                  {
                    "option": "Charon"
                  },
                  {
                    "option": "Aoede"
                  },
                  {
                    "option": "Zephyr"
                  },
                  {
                    "option": "Fenrir"
                  }
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
